# my-app

A [Gonest](https://github.com/omyo-group/gonest) application (NestJS architecture on Gin).

## Run

```sh
go mod tidy
go run .
curl localhost:8080/health
```

## Layout

- `main.go`: bootstraps `app.AppModule` and listens.
- `internal/app`: root module and the health controller.

## Generate code

```sh
gonest g module users
gonest g service users
gonest g controller users
```

Run `gonest g --help` for guards, interceptors, filters, pipes and DTOs.

## Make targets

`make build`, `make run`, `make test`, `make lint`, `make docker`.
